#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:5
msgid "Paste in area"
msgstr "在区域粘贴"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:7
msgid ""
"Past in area is similar command to paste `part`_, the main difference is the"
" place where the `part`_ can be pasted. At normal paste command QElectroTech"
" pastes the `part`_ automatically at a predefined position, at paste in area"
" command the user is free to choose the place where the object has to be "
"pasted by using left click on the desired place."
msgstr ""
"过去在区域中的命令与粘贴 `部件 <part_>`_ 相似，主要区别在于可以粘贴 `部件 <part_>`_ "
"的地方。在正常粘贴命令QEelectroTech上，在预先定义的位置上自动粘贴 `部件 "
"<part_>`_，在区域指令上粘贴，用户可以通过使用左键点击想要的地方来自由选择对象必须粘贴的地方。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:11
msgid ""
"Pasting `parts`_ in area can be done from `menu bar`_, by right click on the"
" `drawing area`_ and from the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"在区域中粘贴 `部件 <parts_>`_ 可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，通过右键点击 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_ "
"和相应的键盘快捷键完成。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:15
msgid "Paste part from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏粘贴部分"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:17
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Paste in the area...** menu item to paste the `part`_ copied"
" or cut previously from `drawing area`_."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 粘贴区域。..** 菜单 `部件 <part_>`_ 复制或剪切之前从 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:18
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:43
msgid ""
"Left click at the `Drawing area`_ point where the `part`_ should be pasted."
msgstr "左键点击 `绘图区 <Drawing area_>`_ 点，`部件 <part_>`_ 点应粘贴。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:23
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:26
msgid "Paste part by right click"
msgstr "右键粘贴部分"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:28
msgid "Right click somewhere from `drawing area`_."
msgstr "从 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_ 右键单击某处 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:29
msgid ""
"Select the option **Paste in the area...** to paste the `part`_ copied or "
"cut previously."
msgstr "选择选项 **粘在那个区域。..** 粘贴 `部件 <part_>`_ 复制或剪切之前。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:30
msgid ""
"Left click at the `drawing area`_ point where the `part`_ should be pasted."
msgstr "左键点击 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_ 点，应该粘贴 `部件 <part_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:35
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech right click PopUp window"
msgstr "图：右键点击弹出窗口的QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:38
msgid "Paste part using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键粘贴部分"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:40
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:42
msgid ""
"Press ``Ctrl + Shift + v`` to paste the `part`_ copied or cut previously "
"from `drawing area`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + Shift + v`` 粘贴 `部件 <part_>`_ 先前从 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste_in_area.rst:47
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
